{"hw":"φυγή","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">φυγή</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">φυγή</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">φεύγω</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">flight</b> in battle, <span class=\"gk\">ἀΐξαντε φυγῇ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Od.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.117</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οὐδέ τις ἀλκὴ.. οὐδὲ φ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22.306</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐς φ. ἐτράποντο</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.89</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐς φ. ὁρμᾶσθαι, ὁρμᾶν,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">143</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.2.28</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">φυγὴν αἱρεῖσθαι, ἀρεῖσθαι,</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pers.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">481</span> </span> (sed leg. <span class=\"gk\">αἴρονται</span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">54</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἰσχυρὰν τὴν φ. τοῖς πολεμίοις.. ἐποίει</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.4.22</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἰσχυρὰ φ. ἐγένετο</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.1.26</span> </span>; generally, <b class=\"lex-tr\">flight, Ev. Matt.</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"